  "executive_briefing": "As the U.S. Senate approaches a decisive September 15, 2026 vote on the CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633), the digital asset market is experiencing significant structural realignment. Regulatory guidelines defining SEC and CFTC oversight and institutional vault operations are providing legal certainty for native smart contract development directly on Bitcoin, creating direct functional competition for Ethereum's EVM ecosystem. Simultaneously, institutional engagement with Bitcoin has evolved from early ETF accumulation into systematic balance sheet management, while cross-chain DeFi is replacing legacy wrapped-asset bridges with trust-minimized, non-custodial swapping architectures to connect BTC and EVM liquidity pools.",
